{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355100/extras/763a239eb00c651e92ac88b686697559.avif?t=1773532867\" width=600 height=192 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep in the vastness of space, a mysterious signal echoes from a planet in the Federated Feline System. Judy, a fearless space bounty hunter, is sent to investigate!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355100/extras/703e74c6e556f998a7745b495882b4ab.poster.avif?t=1773532867\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355100/extras/703e74c6e556f998a7745b495882b4ab.webm?t=1773532867\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355100/extras/703e74c6e556f998a7745b495882b4ab.mp4?t=1773532867\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore richly illustrated environments filled with hidden paths, abandoned temples, frozen labs, and fungal forests await! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355100/extras/a4bd04ce682666852826585010f42b8b.poster.avif?t=1773532867\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355100/extras/a4bd04ce682666852826585010f42b8b.webm?t=1773532867\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355100/extras/a4bd04ce682666852826585010f42b8b.mp4?t=1773532867\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unravel the mysterious story lurking beneath the sur